{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/crest-lane-meraas-city-walk","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":91,"crm_id":"4116","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Crestlane","slug":"crest-lane-meraas-city-walk","display_address":"City Walk","building_type":["apartment","penthouse","duplex"],"completion_year":"2030","developer":"Meraas","price":2700000,"display_price":"2.7M","lattitude":25.2074826,"longitude":55.2625776,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":4,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>The second tower of Crestlane at <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/area-guides/city-walk-dubai/\">City Walk</a> has just been launched, bringing an exciting selection of premium residences to one of Dubai’s most sought-after neighborhoods. The project features <strong>1, 2, 3, and 4-bedroom apartments and 4-bedroom duplexes.</strong> Developed by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://providentestate.com/new-projects/developed-by-meraas/\">Meraas</a>, this vibrant community perfectly balances the buzz of city life with the calm of a waterfront setting. With seamless access to Sheikh Zayed Road, Jumeirah Beach, and Dubai Mall, City Walk Crestlane is ideally located for those who value connectivity and convenience.</p><p>Designed with contemporary living in mind, the development features lush landscaping, tranquil water features, and a host of resort-style amenities. Residents can enjoy jogging tracks, sports courts, dedicated yoga studios, and inviting pools — all set within a dynamic neighborhood that encourages a balanced, active lifestyle.</p>","tile_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/feat_581d619675.jpg","hash":"feat_581d619675","name":"City Walk Crestlane"},"banner_image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu