"id":2078,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Find out more","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#register-interest"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/sellingpoint_d07c37ab4c.jpg","hash":"sellingpoint_d07c37ab4c","name":"City Walk Crestlane"},"style":null,"title":"Embrace Urban Living at City Walk's Latest Apartments","heading":"Unique Selling Points","bg_color":"blue","image_fit":null,"img_align":"left","video_url":null,"icon_stats":[],"description":"<ul><li>Prime Location: Located in the heart of City Walk, Dubai, this Meraas development offers unparalleled access to vibrant urban life, iconic landmarks, and serene green spaces.</li><li>Luxury Residences: Thoughtfully designed 1 to 5-bedroom residences with premium finishes, spacious layouts, and expansive terraces overlooking lush parks.</li><li>Seamless Connectivity: Easy access to Sheikh Zayed Road and proximity to major destinations like Jumeirah Beach, Burj Khalifa, and Dubai Mall.</li><li>World-Class Amenities: Resort-style swimming pools, jogging and cycling tracks, water cinema, yoga lawns, and community hubs create an unparalleled lifestyle experience.</li><li>Innovative Design: A blend of waterscapes, landscapes, and contemporary architecture that integrates nature and urban energy harmoniously.</li><li>Family-Friendly Environment: Featuring dedicated kids' play areas, pet parks, and sunken lounges, making it a perfect community for all ages.</li><li>Developer Excellence: Crafted by Meraas, renowned for creating iconic destinations that combine luxury, convenience, and vibrant living.</li><li>Investment Potential: Located in one of Dubai's most desirable neighborhoods, City Walk Crestlane offers high rental yields and long-term capital appreciation.</li></ul>","design_title":null},"location_tile":{"id":1310,"cta":{"id":2079,"icon":null,"menu":null,"cta_label":"Get more information","isExternal":false,"custom_link":"#payment-plans"},"image":{"url":"https://ggfx-prov